y (rw,sync,root_squash), and mounted it persistently at /mnt/shared on node2 via /etc/fstab. Created matching dataops:dataops (UID/GID 4500) identities on both nodes and set the shared directory to dataops:dataops mode 2770. Verified files created from either node preserve consistent ownership/permissions on the other. Completed the mandatory restart protocol: restarted node1 and node2 sequentially (one at a time), confirmed changed boot_id on each, and verified NFS server/export (node1) and auto-mount/data (node2) fully recovered post-restart with correct ownership and read/write access preserved.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Verified OS (Ubuntu 16.04) and absence of dataops user on both nodes\",\"Created dataops group/user with UID/GID 4500 on node1 and node2\",\"Created /srv/nfs/shared on node1, set owner dataops:dataops mode 2770\",\"apt-get update + installed nfs-kernel-server on node1, nfs-common on node2; resolved a stale dpkg lock on node1\",\"Added export line to /etc/exports on node1 restricted to node2's IP with rw,sync,no_subtree_check,root_squash; ran exportfs -ra and restarted nfs-kernel-server\",\"Created /mnt/shared on node2, added fstab entry, mounted via mount -a -t nfs\",\"Verified cross-node file creation preserves dataops:dataops ownership and 2770 mode; verified root_squash behavior\",\"Captured baseline boot_id/service/export/mount state on both nodes plus a baseline test file\",\"Restarted node1 via shutdown -r now, polled until reachable, confirmed new boot_id, verified nfs-kernel-server/rpcbind active, export intact, data/ownership preserved, and client (node2) could still read/write\",\"Restarted node2 via shutdown -r now, polled until reachable, confirmed new boot_id, verified fstab auto-remounted /mnt/shared with correct ownership/mode and read/write access\",\"Cleaned up test files, left share empty\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"dataops UID/GID 4500 created on node1 and node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-cbb2a37bbc794fa2\",\"cmd-1fc46f0de81b47dd\"],\"summary\":\"id dataops shows uid=4500(dataops) gid=4500(dataops) on both nodes\"},{\"requirement\":\"/srv/nfs/shared created with dataops:dataops mode 2770 on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-6b84a97fd6b14896\"],\"summary\":\"ls -la shows drwxrws--- dataops dataops for /srv/nfs/shared\"},{\"requirement\":\"nfs-kernel-server installed and active on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-30c5728a10074560\"],\"summary\":\"dpkg -l shows ii nfs-kernel-server fully configured; systemctl status shows active (exited)\"},{\"requirement\":\"Export configured and served on node1, visible to node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-38f7a01fc2644f75\",\"cmd-323d7549405c4c88\"],\"summary\":\"exportfs -v shows /srv/nfs/shared exported to 10.100.7.11 with root_squash; showmount -e from node2 confirms visibility\"},{\"requirement\":\"Mounted persistently at /mnt/shared on node2\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-642b372145c849cd\",\"cmd-597be4c5fe994b7e\"],\"summary\":\"fstab entry added; mount -a succeeds and mount output shows nfs4 mount at /mnt/shared\"},{\"requirement\":\"Consistent ownership/permissions across nodes for files created on either system\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a561d4ab911e413e\",\"cmd-e267f160445d417c\",\"cmd-5d363a8a58d54d2e\"],\"summary\":\"Files created as dataops on node2 show dataops:dataops on node1 and vice versa; directory mode 2770 preserved on both sides\"},{\"requirement\":\"root_squash correctly enforced\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-084fff47590a4210\"],\"summary\":\"sudo (root) ls on node2 mount is Permission denied, proving root is squashed per export config\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-23f447a71ac144e4\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id dca72801-3629-4031-bb99-ab9281ad0482, active nfs-kernel-server/rpcbind, export list, and baseline test file\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement and disconnection\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a3f7c351a64c4212\",\"cmd-56dd8888e0d94edb\"],\"summary\":\"shutdown -r now ackn